## Authority Grant

This document establishes delegation authority for AI agents operating within the [PROJECT] context.

**Principle:** Only the human operator can grant delegation authority. Agents cannot self-authorize or expand their own scope.

---

## Delegation Token

```
Token: [PROJECT]-[YEAR]-[OPERATOR_INITIALS]-[RANDOM_4CHAR]
Example: CXMS-2026-RSB-7X9K
```

**Token Location:** This file (or `.local` variant for sensitive deployments)
**Token Rotation:** Annually or after any security incident

