## Delegation Scope Matrix

### By Agent Pair

| Coordinator | Can Delegate To | Task Types | Path Restrictions | Operation Limits |
|-------------|-----------------|------------|-------------------|------------------|
| [COORD_1] | [AGENT_A] | docs, graphics, UI | templates/, docs/ | read, write |
| [COORD_1] | [AGENT_B] | code, tests | src/, tests/ | read, write, execute |

### Task Type Definitions

| Task Type | Description | Example Tasks |
|-----------|-------------|---------------|
| docs | Documentation creation/editing | README updates, guides |
| graphics | Visual asset creation | Diagrams, icons, charts |
| code | Source code implementation | Features, bug fixes |
| tests | Test creation/execution | Unit tests, integration tests |
| research | Information gathering | Web search, file analysis |
| review | Code/doc review | PR reviews, audits |

### Operation Definitions

| Operation | Description | Risk Level |
|-----------|-------------|------------|
| read | Read files only | Low |
| write | Create/modify files | Medium |
| execute | Run commands/scripts | High |
| delete | Remove files | High - Requires explicit scope |

---

## Prohibited Delegations

The following CANNOT be delegated without explicit human approval per-instance:

| Operation | Reason |
|-----------|--------|
| `.local` file modifications | Protected IP/sensitive content |
| Credential/secret access | Security boundary |
| Git force operations | Destructive potential |
| File deletions | Data loss risk |
| External API calls with auth | Security boundary |
| Scope expansion requests | Only human can grant |

---

## Verification Protocol

### For Coordinators (When Delegating)

1. Include delegation token in task file
2. Specify exact scope (paths, operations)
3. Set task expiration (optional)
4. Log delegation in Activity Log

### For Sub-Agents (When Receiving)

1. Verify token matches this authority file
2. Verify coordinator is in Authorized Coordinators list
3. Verify task is within scope matrix
4. Reject if any verification fails
5. Log acceptance/rejection

### Rejection Response Template

```markdown
**DELEGATION REJECTED**

Reason: [Token mismatch | Coordinator not authorized | Task outside scope]
Details: [Specific issue]
Action Required: Human operator must grant explicit approval

Delegation File: [path]
Authority File: [PROJECT]_Delegation_Authority.md
```

